# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Byte Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 04:25  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Structured DTCG-compliant component token definitions for Atlas Core, aligning SaaS platform and face-to-face service interfaces per parameters established in the Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "system": "Atlas Core",
    "version": "1.4.0",
    "author": "Byte Marlow",
    "compliance": {
      "source": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "application": "Utilized Business Document: Company Document to extract enterprise UI standardizations, tactile target minimums for Face to Face service kiosks, and WCAG 2.1 AAA luminance requirements across SaaS workflows."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "$value": "{color.brand.skokosBlue.600}",
          "$type": "color",
          "$description": "Calculated 7.4:1 contrast ratio against light surface tokens."
        },
        "text": {
          "$value": "{color.neutral.000}",
          "$type": "color"
        },
        "minHeight": {
          "saas": { "$value": "36px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "f2fTerminal": { "$value": "48px", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "paddingHorizontal": {
          "saas": { "$value": "{spacing.4}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "f2fTerminal": { "$value": "{spacing.6}", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "borderRadius": { "$value": "{radius.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "serviceRecord": {
        "background": { "$value": "{color.surface.canvas}", "$type": "color" },
        "border": { "$value": "1px solid {color.border.subtle}", "$type": "border" },
        "padding": { "$value": "{spacing.5}", "$type": "dimension" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{elevation.level1}", "$type": "shadow" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```